The gradle-wrapper.jar file needs to be obtained from a Gradle distribution.
To set up this project properly:

1. Open in Android Studio, which will automatically download and configure Gradle
2. Or use a system with Gradle 8.2+ installed and run: gradle wrapper
3. Or download manually from https://services.gradle.org/distributions/gradle-8.2-all.zip

The project structure is complete and ready to build once the Gradle wrapper is properly configured.
